  "analysis": "The Colormind scripts don't exist yet. Based on the SKILL.md documentation, I need to create the scripts directory with list_models.mjs and generate_palette.mjs that interact with the Colormind.io API. The API uses HTTP endpoints: GET http://colormind.io/list/ for listing models and POST http://colormind.io/api/ for generating palettes.",
